{%- comment -%}
  Mobile baseline marker. Emits `cls` when a size setting should be resized by
  the mobile media query in theme.css, i.e. when it's still at its DEFAULT (the
  merchant hasn't customized it) OR when it sits at a shared "standardizable"
  value — headers at 30px, body at 17px — so those also collapse to the mobile
  baseline. Custom sizes outside these values keep their inline value untouched.
  Params: val (current setting value), def (the schema default), cls (class to emit).
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign hit = false
  if val == def
    assign hit = true
  endif
  if cls contains 'mb-h' and val == 30
    assign hit = true
  endif
  if cls contains 'mb-body' and val == 17
    assign hit = true
  endif
-%}
{%- if hit -%}{{ cls }}{%- endif -%}
